          "_name": "people03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people03\" group=\"People\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Name\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Position\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Meet the creators</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mnix-2.jpg-815x1174.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Matthew Nix</b><br><b>President &amp; CEO </b><br><b>Nix Companies</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">Matthew Nix started working as the 5th generation in his family’s mom &amp; pop welding business at the age of 8, sweeping the floor and cleaning machinery for $5.00 a Saturday. Later, he began working in the shop as a summer intern learning the ropes. In addition to learning the trade, he credits much of the values he learned working alongside his father and grandfather. Matthew began working full time for the company in 2004 after receiving a 1 year certification in Welding Technology from Vincennes University. Matthew is an advocate of lifelong learning. In 2017, while still working in the business, he completed his certificate in Executive Business administration from the University of Notre Dame.<br><br>\n<div>Today, Matthew currently serves as the President and CEO of Nix Companies Inc., a holding company he founded in 2017. Among its holdings, remains their family’s 120+ year legacy business. Under the 5th generation’s leadership, the business has grown from 4 family members to a regional company with over 150 team members and has achieved 100X revenue growth in less than 20 years. Matthew is passionate about building a company known for excellence in its people &amp; culture, and he believes business can and should be a force for good. Nix Companies was named to the Inc 5000 fastest growing companies in America for 7 consecutive years, Indiana Companies to Watch, and one of the Best Places to Work in Indiana in 2018, 2019, and 2022.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>Matthew is passionate about adding value to other business owners (especially family business) and his community. He is (or has been) involved in multiple groups and activities to support this mission; some notable ones are the Southwest Indiana Chamber of Commerce- Family Business Alliance – Tri-State Manufacturers Alliance- Posey County Economic Develop – Posey County Redevelopment Commission- Forum 4 Growth, Business owner network- Junior Achievement – and Legatus, Catholic CEO network- Evansville chapter charter member.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://www.nixcompanies.com/forging-ahead-book-order/\" class=\"text-primary\">Forging Ahead</a>, a recently published book, reveals how Matthew, now CEO, and the team he methodically curated leaned on small-town values and faith to transform humble Nix Welding into Nix Industrial, a revered custom manufacturing and industrial repair powerhouse. Today Nix Industrial is one of the fastest growing companies in America.\n</div><div>\n</div><div><br></div>Author Angie Klink paints a vivid portrait of a business saga from America’s heartland. Forging Ahead is a family tale, a coming-of-age story, a business handbook, and a letter to future generations.<br><div><br></div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Solulu Solutions<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jzurborg.jpg-815x1060.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>John Zurborg</b><br><b>Former CEO</b><br><b>Skilcraft</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">John Zurborg brings seasoned executive experience as a coach who empowers entrepreneurs and executives to navigate change, unlock their potential, and achieve results. His background includes working with small to medium-sized privately held companies as CEO, COO, EVP Business Development, and Engineering for rapidly growing companies.<br><br>\n<div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>Driven by a deep-seated passion for inspiring progress John guides clients through the complexities of leadership, fostering clarity, addressing workforce challenges, and nurturing high-performing teams. His ability to establish clear visions, and cultivate cultures of growth has enabled numerous businesses to break through limitations, increase profitability, and facilitate career advancement for employees. John's personalized approach combines his wealth of knowledge with FocalPoint methodologies, equipping business leaders with the tools and strategies to overcome obstacles, achieve their goals, and experience true fulfillment through meaningful transformation.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>As CEO and Owner of Skilcraft, a regional fabricator in NKY, John utilized best practices such as those found in books such as Good to Great, Scaling Up, and 7 Habits of Highly Effective People. He understands the challenges of business leaders. Juggling multiple roles and responsibilities, all while ensuring the satisfaction of shareholders and financial institutions. By establishing a clear vision and fostering a culture of change and progress, he successfully guided Skilcraft to break growth barriers at several stages that resulted in a brand recognized around the world, increased sales over 140%, increased profitability 212% and ultimately, a sale of the company.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>John believes that our communities are better when we are helping others become the best version of themselves. He volunteers in the community with organizations that help prepare young men and women for their adult life. This includes mentoring young men and women to advance their education, careers or to overcome environments as an at-risk individual.\n</div><div>John enjoys spending time with his wife, Susan, their four children, and a growing number of grandchildren. He enjoys boating and being on the water for as many sunsets as possible during the summer.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSphere Innovations\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/charlie2-1.jpg-815x901.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Charles Hinnant\n</b><div><b>Chairman &amp; Owner</b></div><div><b>Optima Chemical LLC</b></div></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">Charles (Charlie) A. Hinnant is the Chairman &amp; owner of Optima Chemical LLC, a custom manufacturing concern in Douglas, GA.\n<div>\n</div><div>Mr. Hinnant was also the founder of Charkit Chemical Corporation located in South Norwalk, CT. Charkit is an international trading and chemical distribution company, acquired by LLB Specialties, where Charlie now serves as a member of their advisory board. Mr. Hinnant was also the owner of Arran Chemical, Athlone, Ireland for twenty years which he sold in 2015 to Almac Group, a global pharmaceutical contract and manufacturing operation.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>Prior to founding Charkit in 1982, Mr. Hinnant was employed by Fairmount Chemical in New Jersey as Vice President of Marketing. Before Fairmount he was employed by Olin Corporation formerly located in Stamford, Connecticut.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>Mr. Hinnant has a BS in Chemistry from Davidson College, an MBA from the University of North Carolina Chapel Hill, and has completed Post Graduate work at Tulane University.</div><br><div>\n</div><div>He currently serves or has served on the:\n</div><div>Visitors Board of the Savannah College of Art &amp; Design (SCAD)\n</div><div>Board of Directors of the Maritime Aquarium (Norwalk, CT)\n</div><div>Davidison College Board of Visitors\n</div><div>United Way of Fairfield County, CT plus Allocation Committees</div><br><div>\n</div><div>Mr. Hinnant’s primary residence is Palm Beach, Florida but spends time in Connecticut, South Carolina and Nantucket as he enjoys many sporting activities especially boating with the extended family including six grandchildren ranging in age from 19 to 4.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBiz TechnoWorks<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
